---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="International Salary Comparisons Paused | Econified" description="Country salary estimates are paused while the location data and currency model are checked." noindex={true} noAds={true}>
  <main class="container" style="max-width: 780px;">
    <article class="glass-panel">
      <h1>International salary comparisons are paused</h1>
      <p>The previous country estimates did not reliably distinguish purchasing-power ratios from local-currency salaries. The location data also needs dated, traceable sources. Those estimates are no longer available.</p>
      <p>For a relocation scenario, use the <a href="/geo-arbitrage-calculator/">relocation budget calculator</a> with your own cost estimates. Enter both salaries and expenses in the same currency. It does not estimate local taxes or tell you a market salary.</p>
      <h2>Other decisions you can compare</h2>
      <ul><li><a href="/commute-cost-calculator/">Calculate driving and parking costs</a></li><li><a href="/job-offer-comparison/">Compare salary and employer benefits</a></li><li><a href="/tools/">Browse all calculators</a></li></ul>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
